{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. <strong>Hack modular code to bend the rules</strong>: heal with fireballs, make foes explode, or trigger absurd chain reactions. Guide your dino with these \u201ccode cheats,\u201d and uncover the game\u2019s hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance it\u2019s a simple turn-based tactics game: guide a tiny dinosaur to defeat enemy dinos. Yet the world is lethal\u2014razor claws, fireballs, and traps all threaten instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Dino Chess is far deeper. You can literally open the game\u2019s backend and edit modular code that governs unit behavior and the rules themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples,Want the enemy\u2019s claw attack? Drag its [Claw] command onto your [Spacebar]. Press Space and\u2014slash!\u2014you now claw too.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy camping in place? Feed it your own [Move] command and watch it march itself into a pit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling wild? Change [On Fireball Hit] from [Die] to [Heal]. Getting blasted now restores HP instead of ending you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more absurd, reality-bending combos await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination, create incredible solutions to each level, and explore the secrets behind the game. Welcome to the world of Dino Chess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is porridge, an indie game developer currently creating this project solo. If you\u2019re interested in the game, please consider adding it to your wishlist! Thank you for your support. More information will be revealed in 2026. If the game receives enough attention and support, I plan to develop additional features such as a level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1756720127","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921050?t=1756720127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/dfecac7d62f5ca125eff81d646c8ddc0fc08c1a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756720127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/dfecac7d62f5ca125eff81d646c8ddc0fc08c1a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756720127","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Domino is a <strong>pixel-art puzzle</strong> game mixing <strong>pseudo-programming</strong> with<strong> turn-based battles</strong>. <strong>Hack modular code to bend the rules</strong>: heal with fireballs, make foes explode, or trigger absurd chain reactions. Guide your dino with these \u201ccode cheats,\u201d and uncover the game\u2019s hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance it\u2019s a simple turn-based tactics game: guide a tiny dinosaur to defeat enemy dinos. Yet the world is lethal\u2014razor claws, fireballs, and traps all threaten instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/37548da0853aead82389f96b3ddac41e.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Dino Chess is far deeper. You can literally open the game\u2019s backend and edit modular code that governs unit behavior and the rules themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examples,Want the enemy\u2019s claw attack? Drag its [Claw] command onto your [Spacebar]. Press Space and\u2014slash!\u2014you now claw too.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/af3e1bdc00675299dce82d5d1bfe3560.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy camping in place? Feed it your own [Move] command and watch it march itself into a pit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/b4dc8f519af22f7e91871fe1903708e3.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling wild? Change [On Fireball Hit] from [Die] to [Heal]. Getting blasted now restores HP instead of ending you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.poster.avif?t=1756720127\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.webm?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/extras/a2809e5726701e5456ff8a400afe6957.mp4?t=1756720127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more absurd, reality-bending combos await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination, create incredible solutions to each level, and explore the secrets behind the game. Welcome to the world of Dino Chess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is porridge, an indie game developer currently creating this project solo. If you\u2019re interested in the game, please consider adding it to your wishlist! Thank you for your support. More information will be revealed in 2026. If the game receives enough attention and support, I plan to develop additional features such as a level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Porridge"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921050/6c9c854c26ff7bfa41923a82ec583879e9645d9f/header.jpg?t=1756720127","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257179245,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179245/movie480.mp4?t=1756720125","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179245/movie_max.mp4?t=1756720125"},"name":"GameplayPV_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257179245/8d3d8b7279f15f2f35f52c2934f39b6e34c34b7b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756720125","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179245/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756720125","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179245/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756720125"}}],"name":"Dino Domino","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong